{"id":"b2648f76681b7d8c","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-tree8-splitting-node.md","title":"ZFC Tree8 Splitting Node","display":"df-zfc-tree8-splitting-node — ZFC Tree8 Splitting Node","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree8-splitting-node","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree8-splitting-node"],"display":"df-zfc-tree8-splitting-node — ZFC Tree8 Splitting Node","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree8-splitting-node"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree8-splitting-node</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree8-splitting-node — ZFC Tree8 Splitting Node"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order\">58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\leq_T,s,t,u\\in V\">\\(T,\\leq_T,s,t,u\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\)</span> (tree-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order\">58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8SplittingNode}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8SplittingNode}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}node} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree8SplittingNode}_S(s,T,\\leq_T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\leq_T)\\land s\\in T\\land\\exists t,u\\in T\\;(s\\neq t\\land s\\neq u\\land\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\\land\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\\land\\neg(t\\leq_T u\\lor u\\leq_T t))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}node} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree8SplittingNode}_S(s,T,\\leq_T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\leq_T)\\land s\\in T\\land\\exists t,u\\in T\\;(s\\neq t\\land s\\neq u\\land\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\\land\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\\land\\neg(t\\leq_T u\\lor u\\leq_T t))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A splitting node has two incomparable strict extensions in the specified tree order.</li>\n<li>The order is now an explicit predicate argument; previously the two-argument predicate depended on a free external relation and was not well-defined.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S$ (tree-order predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T,\\leq_T,s,t,u\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8SplittingNode}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}node} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree8SplittingNode}_S(s,T,\\leq_T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\leq_T)\\land s\\in T\\land\\exists t,u\\in T\\;(s\\neq t\\land s\\neq u\\land\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\\land\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\\land\\neg(t\\leq_T u\\lor u\\leq_T t))","display":true}],"bytes":1187,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3819","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-tree8-splitting-node.md|58-df-zfc-tree8-splitting-node]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d25b709595952a78"]}